suite-lock widget API (feature "gtk") — READY. Additive changes only from here on.
Depend: suite-lock = { workspace = true, features = ["gtk"] }
Strings use suite_core tr!; CSS class names are identical to Python.
Plain-Rust modules (always built): suite_lock::voice_state, suite_lock::palette, suite_lock::expanduser.

